  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "• 公式外伝『機動戦士ガンダム 鉄血のオルフェンズ 月鋼』第2期に登場のライバル機「ガンダム・ダンタリオン」が早くもHGでキット化！",
      "en": "• The rival machine \"Gundam Dantalion \" that appeared in the second season of the official side story \" Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans Steel\" has already been made into an HG kit!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 特徴的な機体デザインが、迫力ある大型装備とともに圧倒的ボリュームで再現！",
      "en": "• The distinctive aircraft design is reproduced in overwhelming volume along with impressive large equipment!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 関節に新機構が採用され、Tブースター装備からハーフカウルT装備状態への換装ギミックを実現！",
      "en": "• A new mechanism has been adopted for the joints, making it possible to convert from T booster equipment to half cowl T equipment!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 付属のソードライフルは、ライフルモードからソードモードへの変形が可能！",
      "en": "• The included sword rifle can be transformed from rifle mode to sword mode!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 初回限定同梱としてガンダムトライエイジのカードが付属！",
      "en": "• A Gundam Try Age card is included as a first-time limited bundle!"
    }
  ],
